The best solution I found serves all 100 customers with 13 vehicles, is feasible (no late arrivals, no excess load), and has a total distance of 1009.8. The evaluator confirmed a score of 1009.8. Since the score equals the distance, there are no penalties.

This is the best of the solutions I found, not a proven optimum. The methods I ran were a greedy heuristic (1911.5, feasible), tabu search (infeasible: 18 late arrivals), a genetic algorithm (2311.2, using all 25 vehicles), and ant colony optimisation (1009.8, reproduced on a second run). I did not run an exact method, and I did not hand-tune the ACO routes further.

